{title: Serving God is Beautiful}
{key: G}
{x_theme: faith-trust}
{x_source: chrd:serving_god_is_beautiful.chrd}

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Serving [Em]God is beautiful
[D]Serving the King of [G]Kings
I [G]serve Him because I [C]love Him you [Am]see
Serving [D]God is beautiful to [G]me

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Many is the time I've [Am]seen God change a life,
Take a [D]broken heart and put it back to[G]gether.
And when I am asked I look [C]down on that night
It [D]seems that they would say with all there [G]might

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]And as the years go by [Am]we've seen steady smile
Of those [D]faithful saints who really love [G]their Saviour
And even after all the [C]trials they went through
